<title>USA: IPO FILING-Titan Exploration Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Titan Exploration Inc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Exploration Inc has filed for an initial public offering of 12.61 million shares of stock to be sold in a range of $9.50 to $11.50.</p>
<p>The Midland, Texas company plans to offer 12.5 million shares in the offering while 110,000 shares are being sold by a selling stockholder.  </p>
<p>Lead underwriter CS First Boston said the IPO was tentatively slated for the week of December 9.</p>
</text>
